{#
  build/review.j2 — review prompt for the build workflow.

  Evaluates the implementation against the originating Linear ticket.
  Uses Jinja's `inputs.linear_id` directly (resolved at render time).

  Required: inputs.linear_id must be in scope (set by the engine).
  submit_tool_name injected by the contract engine.
#}
Review the implementation against these criteria: correctness relative to Linear ticket {{ inputs.linear_id }} acceptance criteria, adequate test coverage, focused diff (no drive-by changes), no obvious regressions.

Read the diff or relevant files, then identify issues. Tag each finding with one of: HIGH, MEDIUM, LOW.

Be concrete — point to file and line where possible. A clean review (no findings) is a valid result; do not invent issues to fill space.

When done, call {{ submit_tool_name | default('submit') }} exactly once with the verdict and findings list.
